Re: Change 32136: Eliminate some uses of sv_setpv() where we already know the length.
Nicholas Clark  wrote:
> Change 32136 by nicholas@nicholas-saigo on 2007/10/18 18:06:29
>
> ==== //depot/perl/gv.c#383 (text) ====
> Index: perl/gv.c
> --- perl/gv.c#382~32132~        2007-10-18 09:15:22.000000000 -0700
